<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Dunlop 1996 profits lower, div up.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Dunlop 1996 profits lower, div up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for tyre makers Dunlop Nigeria Plc to end-December 1996.</p>
<p>			   (In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>					1996	1995</p>
<p>Turnover			   3,400  vs 3,400</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	  436.5 vs 545.6</p>
<p>Taxation			    107.6 vs 144</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	   328.9 vs 401</p>
<p>Proposed dividend per share 70 kobo vs 60 kobo</p>
<p>NOTE: The company is also proposing a bonus share issue of one new share for two.</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
